     0004             (    ../defs/os9.d):00850         CCode               EQU       4                   C I-code
     0005             (    ../defs/os9.d):00851         CblCode             EQU       5                   Cobol I-code
     0006             (    ../defs/os9.d):00852         FrtnCode            EQU       6                   Fortran I-code
