                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00293         * Card buffers are: 1=card back, 2-14=A to K Diamonds, 15-27=A to K Hearts,
                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00294         *   28-40=A to K Spades, 41-53=A to K Clubs, 54=Joker, 55=Empty card slot.
                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00295         
                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00296         *
                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00297         * font buffer numbers (standard 3 - others are in /dd/sys/fontlist.txt)
