                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00299                             ORG       1
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00300         Fnt.S8x8            RMB       1                   standard 8x8 font
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00301         Fnt.S6x8            RMB       1                   standard 6x8 font
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00302         Fnt.G8x8            RMB       1                   standard graphics 8x8 font
                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00303         *
