00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00309         Pat.Hrz             RMB       1                   horizontal line pattern
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00310         Pat.XHtc            RMB       1                   cross hatch pattern
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00311         Pat.LSnt            RMB       1                   left slanted lines
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00312         Pat.RSnt            RMB       1                   right slanted lines
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00313         Pat.SDot            RMB       1                   small dot pattern
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00314         Pat.BDot            RMB       1                   large dot pattern
                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00315         * MVCanvas extended set
