00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00319         Pat.Shng            RMB       1                   shingle pattern
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00320         Pat.Bric            RMB       1                   brick pattern
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00321         Pat.SmGr            RMB       1                   small grid pattern
