00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00329         Ptr.Pen             RMB       1                   Pencil pointer
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00330         Ptr.LCH             RMB       1                   Large cross hair pointer
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00331         Ptr.Slp             RMB       1                   Wait timer pointer
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00332         Ptr.Ill             RMB       1                   Illegal action pointer
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00333         Ptr.Txt             RMB       1                   Text pointer
