                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00445                             ORG       0
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00446         WT.NBox             RMB       1                   No Box
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00447         WT.FWin             RMB       1                   Framed Window
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00448         WT.FSWin            RMB       1                   Framed Window w/Scroll Bars
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00449         WT.SBox             RMB       1                   Shadowed Box
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00450         WT.DBox             RMB       1                   Double Box
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00451         WT.PBox             RMB       1                   Plain Box
                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00452         
