                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00456                             ORG       1
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00457         MId.Mov             RMB       1                   move box
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00458         MId.Cls             RMB       1                   close box
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00459         MId.Grw             RMB       1                   grow box
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00460         MId.SUp             RMB       1                   scroll up
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00461         MId.SDn             RMB       1                   scroll down
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00462         MId.SRt             RMB       1                   scroll right
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00463         MId.SLt             RMB       1                   scroll left
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00464         MId.Chr             RMB       1                   character was depressed
                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00465                             ORG       20
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00466         MId.Tdy             RMB       1                   Tandy menu
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00467         MId.Fil             RMB       1                   Files Menu
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00468         MId.Edt             RMB       1                   Edit Menu
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00469         MId.Sty             RMB       1                   Styles menu
00FA                  (./defs/cocovtio.d):00470         MId.Fnt             RMB       1                   Font menu
                      (./defs/cocovtio.d):00471         
